  "body": "Ready to secure the ultimate lifestyle before summer peaks? The motivated vendors of this brand-new home are ready to talk deals today!\r\n\r\nTucked away in a peaceful, family-friendly cul-de-sac, this home is your golden ticket to the Eastern Bays. Imagine waking up and taking a breezy stroll down to St Heliers beach, grabbing your morning flat white at a local café, or enjoying waterfront dinners just minutes drive away.\r\n\r\nWhy you'll love it:\r\n\r\n• Crafted to Perfection: Built by a fastidious builder with flawless contemporary finishes throughout.\r\n\r\n• The Ultimate Entertainer: A gorgeous, high-spec kitchen complete with a butler's scullery—perfect for hosting!\r\n\r\n• Effortless Summer Living: Incredible indoor-outdoor flow leads to low-maintenance spaces designed for sizzling BBQs, alfresco dining, and soaking up the sun.\r\n\r\n• Room for Everyone: Four spacious bedrooms offer ultimate flexibility for families, guests, or a work-from-home setup.\r\n\r\n• Year-Round Comfort: Fully equipped with a powerful heat pump to keep you cool in summer and cosy in winter.\r\n\r\nLocated in the Glendowie College and St Ignatius Primary zone and surrounded by the Bays’ best parks and beaches, this is the ultimate upgrade for young families, first-home buyers or downsizers looking for lock-and-leave luxury.\r\n\r\nCall me right now to make your move!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
